{
  "note": "How each downloaded file in incoming/ becomes game clips. Run: node tools/process-sounds.mjs [ids…]. Originals are removed after processing; they stay in git history (batch 1: 45f0a32, batch 2: 0e73ed3, hum: 970a0ac).",
